<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Oil omits payout again.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Oil omits payout again.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Oil and Gas Royalty Trust said it will not pay a distribution for the month of March.</p>
<p>It said Class A costs exceeded gross proceeds by about $126,000 resulting in a cumulative cost carry-forward of about $3.75 million. In addition, net current month administrative expenses of $29,000 will be paid from its administrative expense reserve resulting in about $1.9 million remaining in the expense reserve.</p>
</text>
